#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Polite News is a fast, clean and fully responsive news and magazine WordPress theme with a modern card based layout. It ships with a built in dark mode, a breaking news ticker, featured post section, editor pick cards, rounded card grids, multiple blog layouts, header and footer options, sidebar options and a one click primary colour option. Besides that, it comes with custom widgets for popular posts, tags and categories, contact details, a call to action, a banner, author information, recent posts and social icons, plus breadcrumbs, social sharing, related posts, a sticky sidebar and ajax load more. Every font and icon is served from the theme folder, so the theme makes no external requests. Perfect for newspaper, magazine, editorial, blog and personal news websites. More Details: https://templatesell.com/downloads/polite-news-magazine-wordpress-theme/"
msgstr ""

